WEBVTT

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.610
I couldn't do anything to foil Urachi's plan.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.610
Is his plan that perfect?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:15.470
I tried out every method I could think of,

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.830
but it always went just as he wanted.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.870
All knowledge of abilities would
always be erased from Sakurada.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.190
Wouldn't you be able to choose a future
where Ukawa doesn't use her ability?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.290
No.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.320
Even if I were able to stop her
from using her ability today,

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.130
she'd use it in some other way later.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.790
It'd be best to just repeat it
over and over until you succeed.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:41.280
But the problem is that there's no certain
criteria that'd guarantee our victory.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.770
However much I held Urachi's plan back,
it'd still never result in his defeat.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.150
He'd just prepare another plan.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.770
He won't stop until his plan succeeds,

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.900
so we need a way to stop him before that happens.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.960
But I wasn't able to find that way.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.490
If you couldn't, there's no one else who could.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:02.540
Why?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.410
The rules of abilities are absolute.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:09.370
It's impossible unless there's someone
with an ability rivaling or exceeding yours.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:11.130
Do you really think so?

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:16.680
You have a bad habit of beating around the bush
when you already know the answer.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:20.890
You see, Souma.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.810
I don't want to create a girl
whose only purpose is to disappear.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.830
I know.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:30.100
Still, you will do it.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.280
Kei, use the clairvoyance ability.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.210
Use my ability

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:43.450
and find the future I wasn't able to find myself.

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.250
Your own ideal future.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.160
That's all I was going to say.

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.870
My work here is done.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.070
Everything is now in your hands.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:58.600
I know.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.970
I'll aim for the best outcome.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.730
How is it?

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:07.720
It's very good.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.150
It's also somehow nostalgic.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.840
A lot of tomatoes,

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.150
and just a little bit of yogurt was the key.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:20.840
My mother used to add yogurt to make sure
it wouldn't be too spicy when I was young.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.320
She kept reducing the amount,

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.980
but there was always a little bit of it in our curry.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.160
But it's a bit different, isn't it?

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.630
That's true. Any particular reason?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.890
No, there isn't.

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:36.390
I just couldn't recreate it.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.980
Second Time
Tuesday
October 24th

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:24.510
Excuse me! I'm looking for a café.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.990
It's called Small Forest.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.910
Oh, then it's just...

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.710
<i>I can see her future.
Oh, then it's just...</i>

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:31.230
I think it's...
<i>I can see her future.</i>

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.210
<i>Seems like they reset.
I think it's...</i>

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.190
Thank you very much.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.280
That really helps.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.190
No problem.

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:43.480
<i>My role was over before I even realized.</i>

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.050
<i>I don't have any reason to meet
Urachi Masamune anymore.</i>

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:50.640
<i>Actually, I shouldn't let him catch me.</i>

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.470
<i>Now I'm Kei's weakness,</i>

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.850
<i>so I can't let myself put him at a disadvantage.</i>

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.340
It's surprisingly hard to find a parking lot.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:05.320
If we don't hurry up, we'll be late for
our appointment with the second Witch.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.920
I'll answer.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.080
Hello?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.540
I've found a parking lot.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.100
No need for it anymore.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:19.710
The second Witch was on the way to the café,
but changed her course.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.660
Seems like she wants to ignore our appointment.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.810
What are we going to do?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.130
We'll go after her.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.590
I know where she currently is.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.840
Let's pick up Kagaya first.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.370
Roger.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:33.300
Right before going off course,

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:36.240
the Witch apparently asked
someone where the café is.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:39.650
Is it possible she figured something
out from seeing their future?

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.460
Of course.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.100
Just by looking three days ahead,

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.240
she can see if a reset has been used or not.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:49.240
She confirmed that and changed her route.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.860
Hi, good to see you.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:57.760
Lock this, please.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.680
Contact the observers.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.920
They should start tracking
the future-seer immediately.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.230
Roger.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.010
Has there been a reset?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.200
Yeah.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.510
Interesting.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.440
Apparently my plan succeeded
without any problems.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.020
I don't understand.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.780
It means that a reset has been used

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:21.810
after all the information about abilities
had been erased from Sakurada.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.320
Asai must have done something.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.000
Could he have used one of that old man's pictures?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.550
Why would I have overlooked that?

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.710
Well, either way, it's not a problem.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.700
Everything is proceeding smoothly.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.080
We'll just proceed into the next phase of the plan.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.160
I consider that boy and his friends

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.840
obstacles to my plan.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.580
Let's get rid of them efficiently.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.310
Kei, what on earth is happening?

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.730
The situation is so complicated
it's hard to even begin to explain,

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:54.810
and we don't have time.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:58.560
Could you spare half an hour
helping me without asking anything?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.740
Well, I don't mind.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.520
You always seem busy.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.360
That's not true.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.930
I'm just usually busy when I ask you for help.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:10.230
The school festival is tomorrow though.

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:13.630
For me, it was three days ago.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.030
Is this just the three of us?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.030
No, there's one more.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.840
We'll be meeting up with Sakagami.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.330
Huh, that brings back memories.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:24.380
What was that little girl called again...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.110
Kurakawa Mari.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.610
Now that I think about it,
we're really the same group as in that case.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.620
Souma's not here.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.310
No, she is.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.050
These are special pictures taken using an ability.

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:42.600
If we tear them, we can enter the world
captured on them for ten minutes.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.150
Meaning we can meet Souma?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.310
Yeah.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.510
For just ten minutes,
the same Souma as two years ago.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.090
It's been a while, Sakagami.

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.330
Yeah, it has.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.330
Is what you said true?

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.480
Yes, I'm going to prove it now.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.500
I want to help her.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.790
Anyway, let's go see Souma.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.470
It's so hard to believe.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.860
We don't have the time to explain the situation.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.310
I'm only going to tell you
what you need to understand.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.040
Once we enter the picture,

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.260
please copy Souma's ability to me, Sakagami.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:25.560
Then, for ten minutes,

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.610
you can talk to her about anything you want.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.850
Okay.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:32.720
Tomoki, use your ability when I need it.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.510
And keep track of the time.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:35.490
You can count on me.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:39.980
I want you to keep talking with me,
it doesn't matter what about.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.430
Talking?

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.080
It's necessary in order to see the future.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.550
You have to talk to a person to see their future.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:51.270
If I look at yours, I'll be able to
more or less figure out mine as well.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.380
I understand.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.870
<i>What I'm going to do now</i>

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.390
<i>will create a girl who will
disappear after ten minutes.</i>

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.400
<i>Just because I need to use her ability,</i>

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.430
<i>I'm going to create a girl
who can by no means be saved.</i>

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.730
<i>It'll be a girl identical to Souma Sumire...</i>

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.780
Let's start.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.540
Are we inside the picture?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.460
I've been waiting for you, Kei.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:41.640
<i>Is Urachi Masamune chasing me now?</i>

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.270
<i>I wish I could confirm it with my ability,</i>

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.190
<i>but I can't use my clairvoyance now.</i>

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:51.690
<i>The future seen with it can be
changed only by a future-seer.</i>

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:56.320
<i>I'm sure Kei is watching the future
now inside the picture.</i>

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.490
<i>If I use my ability carelessly,</i>

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.620
<i>I might accidentally change the future Kei saw.</i>

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.130
It's been a while.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.800
Souma...

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:15.920
Souma.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.420
How much do you know?

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.470
I'm pretty sure I know more or less everything.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:25.180
Hasn't everything progressed
according to my script up until now?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.230
Now, copy my ability to Kei.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.190
Souma, you...

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.360
We can talk later.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.400
There's really no time.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.940
O-Okay.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.820
I'm ready.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.910
Kei, instructions.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.490
Look at Haruki's future.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.120
For now, 48 hours from now should be fine.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.080
Okay.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.960
Let's talk about something.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.170
I understand.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:11:00.380
<i>Somehow I suddenly know things
I shouldn't be knowing yet.</i>

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.010
<i>Everything Haruki knows 48 hours from now,</i>

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.270
<i>all her thoughts, all her feelings, are in my mind.</i>

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:12.100
<i>This isn't just some simple clairvoyance.</i>

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:16.110
The people I use my ability on
have a tremendous effect on me.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.690
It's probably because I got this ability

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:22.530
before I was born,
before I was even aware of myself.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.620
This ability destroys your sense of self.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.330
That's why, Kei,

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:32.630
right after I met you,
I couldn't escape from you anymore.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:40.130
The future I saw through your mind was kinder,
sadder, and prettier than anyone else's.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.640
And so I couldn't turn my eyes away from you.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.390
Continue.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.770
<i>First, about Souma.</i>

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.690
<i>I'll memorize everything Haruki knows in two days.</i>

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.900
What should we talk about?

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.030
Anything you want.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.950
Some meaningless small talk would be nice.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.160
Something simple and harmless.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.880
Good evening.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.220
You're the second Witch, am I wrong?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:27.680
<i>What I should be prioritizing right now
is not getting caught by Urachi Masamune.</i>

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>Not becoming a hostage so that
I don't become a problem for Kei.</i>

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:36.060
<i>I've already done everything I could to help him.</i>

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.070
<i>That's why I can sacrifice absolutely anything.</i>

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.320
Tomoki! Use your ability!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.990
To Souma Sumire! Now!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.450
Huh? Souma?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.320
Hurry up!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.950
<i>Goodbye, Kei...</i>

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.290
Wait, Souma!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.290
Buy me just five minutes!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.420
I'm using these ten minutes of clairvoyance

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.790
just to see your future.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.420
I won't see anything regarding Urachi Masamune.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.130
You know what that means, don't you, Souma?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.140
I'll have to meet with you once more.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.600
You'll have to use your ability for me again.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.140
If you don't, nothing will be solved.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.770
<i>No one asked you to...</i>

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.270
<i>Haven't I done enough already?</i>

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.650
<i>Haven't I done everything in my power?</i>

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.650
<i>What else do you expect of me?</i>

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.650
Don't you go pushing all the sadness
onto me and disappearing like that.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.990
If you want to save me, just buy me five minutes.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:32.040
What can you possibly do in just five minutes...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.870
Did you say something?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.620
I told you not to come near me.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.670
Cancel the clairvoyance and reuse immediately.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.420
24 hours from now this time.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.920
What happened?

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.260
I honestly can't believe this.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.380
It's ridiculous.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.890
I don't remember the last time I heard you shout.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.060
I also don't remember the last time
I shouted without thinking.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.850
How mean.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.520
Let me remind you that you
ran away from our appointment.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:02.020
When a girl turns you down,
you should just accept it and leave her alone.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.570
Really? I think there's something
to be gained from not giving up.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.860
I believe in effort bringing results.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.950
I apologize for not going to the café.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.120
Promises should be kept after all.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.450
It's not too late.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.870
You promised you'd cooperate with me.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:19.830
True.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.250
I'll give you the information you want, then.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.130
Let's hear it. I can't wait.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.760
Asai Kei used the reset ability.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.260
I know that.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.890
How was he able to use it?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:35.470
What did you do wrong before the reset?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.140
Do you know that as well?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.190
No, but it's been on my mind.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:43.150
Seems like I'm overlooking something.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.400
That's true.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.570
You made one mistake before the reset.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:51.070
And what could that one mistake be?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:55.120
The first thing you should've done
was ask me who I am.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.130
Who... are you?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.380
I'm not Souma Sumire.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.590
I don't know myself who I am.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:13.430
I'm definitely not the same person
as the one who died two years ago.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.100
I'm a nameless system.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:21.900
I'm but a system that was designed
by Souma Sumire two years ago.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.030
I'm shocked. Strongly impressed, even.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.400
That's certainly something
I couldn't have expected.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.320
I see, I see...

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.370
How unpleasant.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.660
What a disgusting plan to come up with.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.420
This is insane.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.420
Can a human really treat itself that cruelly?

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.800
You died and got revived

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.930
just to abandon your identity.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:58.350
Before the world was reset,
you asked me two questions.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:01.940
First one was "Will my plan succeed?"

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.020
I answered that it would.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.440
And it did.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:10.650
The second one was "Will you try to foil my plan?"

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.740
I answered that I wouldn't.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.950
And I didn't.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:19.450
You shouldn't have asked it using "you".

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.750
I'm not Souma Sumire, after all.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.790
I might not be doing anything,
but Souma Sumire opposed you.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.590
Let me ask properly this time.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.760
Everything was planned
by Souma Sumire, wasn't it?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.140
A single girl who died two years ago

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.050
prepared everything, all of this.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.600
That's true.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:43.310
Everything was planned by
the real Souma Sumire, not me.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:47.190
Even I am just a pawn controlled by her.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.230
She wanted to help Kei.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:53.200
But she wouldn't be able to escape from you.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.780
She also wouldn't be able
to hide anything from Index.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.450
That's why she prepared a scapegoat.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.830
That's me.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.330
What a shock, really.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.790
No one could have seen through such a lie.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.460
Kei noticed.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.590
I see. Asai Kei...

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.210
He is insane as well.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.050
He isn't.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.720
He's the only one who is always righteous.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:20.640
There's no way someone who never makes
mistakes and is always righteous could be sane.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:24.810
A girl he was friends with committed
suicide just to lose her identity.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.940
He figured out such a complicated situation,

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.520
so he must be out of his mind.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.070
There's something I need to ask you.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.530
Will I know the answer?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:40.530
In the world with no abilities,
what did Asai Kei do before resetting?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.040
What do you mean?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.410
After all abilities disappeared from Sakurada,

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.040
until the point Asai Kei used the reset ability.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.250
What happened in that timeframe?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.130
I mean the time when I couldn't
lock my notebooks anymore.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.920
He did a lot.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.800
He spent time with me,
who was an ordinary high schooler,

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.390
and went back to his home town.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.350
I don't care.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.020
Didn't he read this notebook?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.150
Didn't he steal this notebook from me by force,

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.730
as I forgot everything about abilities,

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.980
and confirm everything about my plan?

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.150
That night, Kei—

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.860
It's been five minutes. Good job.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.070
Fall right behind you.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:22.620
Kei did something you wouldn't
even be able to imagine.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:30.130
<i>Ah, I see. This is definitely not
something a sane person would do.</i>

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:33.250
<i>Being able to do this without any doubts at all</i>

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.710
<i>is something only two people in this world can do.</i>

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.510
<i>Me and—</i>

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.510
Whole body. Impact.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.430
Oh, what. You're not Kei.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.690
Not quite.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:53.480
Good that I asked Murase to look for Souma.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.940
We have three minutes left in this world.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.450
Souma, use your clairvoyance again.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.200
The target is 24 hours from now.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.080
Kei. It's not the time to be thinking about me—

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:03.830
We don't have time.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.290
What's your favorite color, Kei?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.870
Blue, I guess?

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.960
Very deep blue.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.790
Or light blue, almost transparent.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.090
<i>I have to meet with Souma Sumire again.</i>

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:19.630
<i>I have to make sure
Urachi Masamune can't reach her,</i>

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.760
<i>so I need a safe route.</i>

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.430
Use your ability again.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.810
Target tomorrow, around noon.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.810
Do you not like red?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:28.680
I don't dislike it.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.770
It stands out too much, though.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.440
How about a green, like leaves on trees?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.730
It's very nice. I love it.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.320
<i>I see! This is it!</i>

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.120
Tomoki, send a message.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.280
To Souma.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.580
Ready when you are!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.410
Good job, Souma.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.830
Keep going north that way,
and turn east at the third intersection.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:55.130
There should be a taxi waiting
for the lights right in front of you.

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.920
Hail it with Murase,

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.090
and go to Nanasaka Middle School first.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.430
Exactly four minutes thirty
seconds later, leave the taxi.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.180
Take a bus to the station.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:07.390
If you catch the first train after
you get there, everything will be fine.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:12.390
You'll be safer going out of the town
than anywhere in Sakurada.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.020
Souma.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:17.610
Don't worry about me and use your clairvoyance.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.190
Investigate into your own future to make sure

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.150
you don't come back to
Sakurada by noon tomorrow.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.450
Bye. We'll meet again.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.280
Two minutes left.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:27.620
Use your ability again.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.410
Same target, tomorrow around noon.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.040
From now on, every time I point my index finger,

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.080
use your ability again in the same way.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.750
Haruki, what's your favorite color?

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:39.880
I like deep red.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.590
That's kind of surprising.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.760
Is it?

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:49.140
One minute left.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.850
Yeah.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.270
I didn't think you'd really have a favorite.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.480
In the past two years,

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.940
I've come to like a lot of things.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:01.780
For example, I like both cats and cream puffs.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.700
That's good to hear.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.410
I think it's very nice to like more things.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.660
I agree.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.330
Thank you, Souma.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.370
I will definitely not forget you.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.710
It's fine.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.920
There's no time to be sad in these ten minutes.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.670
Goodbye, Kei.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.350
Will Souma Sumire be saved?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:32.720
Of course.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.730
Souma will be happy.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.820
Every time a new morning comes,
she will open her eyes with pleasure,

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:46.740
and she will be content with her life
every time she goes to sleep.

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:52.410
I'll make sure to make such
an everyday life possible for her.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.500
Next Episode

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.130
What I want to see is how you lose!

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.670
You erased the Bureau's decision with a reset.
What I want to see is how you lose!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.340
I'm glad you ran away from your troubles for once.
You erased the Bureau's decision with a reset.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:03.210
Your defeat has been assured.
I'm glad you ran away from your troubles for once.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.090
Your defeat has been assured.

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:05.340
I don't want to fight.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.590
The meeting to decide Sakurada's future.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.010
This is the end.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:20.400
On such a cold dark sky of grey

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:26.610
Rises the sun, which breathes life into it

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.870
A scenery so plain and so mundane

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:42.460
And yet it seems to break my heart, it's so dear to me

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:46.920
As the time never stops passing by

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:49.300
You get lost while searching for

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:53.180
Pure like the rays of a morning star

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.100
What we all yearn for the most

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.520
In what colors bliss is dyed

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:02.150
Struggling against all your past mistakes

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.190
At last from the answer you found kindness fills your heart

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:06.480
More beautiful than anything you know

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.360
More beautiful than anything you know

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.990
And you find it behind a dark veil of sadness

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.490
If I closed my eyes and stopped my thoughts

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.240
If it were so simple to just

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:19.250
Lock your own heart

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:22.380
How lovely life would be

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:27.630
But I believe you have the key

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:33.970
To let my soul be free
